                "text": "Grateful to the folks at @LeisureWorldMd for hosting us this morning. Our older Americans deserve unwavering support for their Social Security, Medicaid, and Medicare.\n\nAs your next Senator, I'll defend these essential benefits every step of the way. https://t.co/FX2nGYnku0",
