                "text": "Ensuring access to comprehensive healthcare services, including reproductive care, is non-negotiable. That\u2019s why fighting for reproductive rights has been a cornerstone of my work and I'll continue to stand up for these rights in the Senate. https://t.co/HIpcqatoXM",
