                "text": "I\u2019m grateful to have the support of the @NorthBaltCoDems  in our race for U.S. Senate.\n\nTheir endorsement reflects our shared commitment to fighting for quality education, accessible healthcare, and justice reform. Together, we're moving Maryland forward. https://t.co/SRwAZeeAa7",
