                "text": "I appreciated the chance to join Ms. Chamblee at the Jericho Residences Tenants Association meeting in Landover last night. From protecting earned benefits to capping insulin costs for folks on Medicare, I will always fight for Maryland\u2019s older adults. https://t.co/e5VIishkzB",
